      "review_summary": "The PR replaces unbounded legacy Reef Doctor-migration file reads with descriptor-bound capped readers and archives oversized legacy sources for manual recovery.\n\nPR surface: Source +137. Total +137 across 3 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. from source for the upgrade boundary: an oversized legacy file enters the new oversized handler and is not imported into canonical state. A final-head end-to-end Doctor reproduction is still missing.",
